<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The genius girl, as everyone agrees, me included: <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>, age 15.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島万歳.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "五島登場" "人物1" "4" "100" "300" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
Arriving on the scene once again!
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\公園.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I came back to the park, alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The rubberneckers had mostly disappeared, but the park still seemed to be off-limits.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Now then, now then, as for what Goto is going to do from here... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">It's door-to-door questioning and nothing else, sir!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ昼.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\公園.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\草むら.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Plain old door-to-door questioning has its limits. I need to come up with a new Operation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked like getting any more new information out of questioning was no longer possible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\五島芝生.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I lay down spread-eagled on the grass beside the park.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜越しの曇天.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I closed my eyes, <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>'s dream from earlier came back to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And also that my <STYLE ID="2">senpais</STYLE> had been childhood friends since they were small.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That conversation between my senpais earlier... something about it was strange.<PG>
Whether it has anything to do with this incident or not...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I still don't really know, but I just end up overthinking things, though I know this is a bad habit of mine.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\五島芝生.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah! Break time, break time! Resting properly is important for making an Operation succeed too, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sun wasn't out, so it wasn't all that bright.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no wind either, and the temperature wasn't bad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I'll take a little nap...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
Somehow, scenes from long ago came to mind, in a form that was neither quite dream nor memory.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I was very little, in this season, my family went to a zoo once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which zoo was it we went to, again?
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "12" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"A p-pretty girl..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly, a man's voice nearby.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't quite make out what he'd said, though.<PG>
When I opened my eyes―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\草むら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A man was standing there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He was maybe about 30 years old.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tall, with handsome, well-formed features.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet... his expression was strangely stiff.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... who are you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Uh, uh, uh... well, um..."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "伊勢.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I spoke to <STYLE ID="3">the man</STYLE>, his expression stiffened even more and he grew flustered.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, he went on to speak to me in a forceful tone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! This area is off-limits to anyone but the police! Get out of here, now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Going by what he said, is <STYLE ID="3">this person</STYLE> a police officer?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But he was restless, and breaking into a strange sweat.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry! So this place is off-limits too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stood right up and gave <STYLE ID="3">the man</STYLE> a meek <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="わ">apology</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ah, ahhh! No! As long as you understand, that's fine!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, <STYLE ID="3">the man</STYLE> looked down, as if embarrassed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, you're with the police, right?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I-indeed! Motoki Police Station, Assistant Inspector </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="だいじろう">Daijiro </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="いせ">Ise</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\警察手帳.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "C" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>, as the man called himself, thrust his police badge at me forcefully.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I really couldn't tell whether he was full of vigor or all jittery.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "35" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
But, if <STYLE ID="3">he</STYLE> is a police officer, and one with the rank of assistant inspector at that, there's a chance I could get some good information.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been feeling the limits of door-to-door questioning anyway, so, well, nothing to lose; I'll just try asking.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, can I ask you something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢驚き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I said that, <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> started panicking even more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wh-wh-what! <TXSPS>I-I-I-I-I'm<TXSPN> telling you, I'm a police officer! I am by no means a suspicious person!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I didn't suspect him at all, he started making excuses, foaming at the corners of his mouth.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... I've been looking into this incident in all sorts of ways, and I was hoping you could give me a little information."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Looking into the incident...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know that normally, you can't ask about this kind of thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But having come this far, all that's left is to push through by force.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\五島スマイル.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢驚き.gal" "WAIT" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I made my appeal with my specialty: a big grin.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ugh...! D-dazzling...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> took three steps back, reeling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> put a hand to his chest and took a big, deep breath.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahem... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what's your name?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> asked as he straightened his tie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Assistant Inspector, sir</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! I am the genius girl, as everyone agrees, me included! Motoki High School first-year, Erina Goto, sir!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gave a crisp salute.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>'s eyes suddenly began to shine.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wha...!? I-I thought it couldn't be, but you're the Motoki Pretty Girl Appreciation Society's No. 1 in popularity, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He spoke so fast I couldn't catch it well, but I felt like there had been a word I didn't know.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考える.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm the Motoki... what was that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, no, no! I said the one they call Motoki High's No. 1 genius, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh, so I'm that famous!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he knows that much, there seems to be room to negotiate.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Just what I'd expect from you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Assistant Inspector, sir</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Indeed, an easy perfect score on the recent entrance exam! The greatest genius girl since Motoki High School was founded, Erina Goto, sir!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a grin, I gave a crisp salute.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
As I stood like that, <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> began to observe me closely.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm... So that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is investigating the incident. Um, how far have </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> gotten in looking into it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ummm, let's see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I told him my deduction about the incident, the same way as before.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"―And so, I'm guessing the body had been flayed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmmm..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Just what you'd expect of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">genius girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. Powers of deduction that are nothing to laugh at..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh? So that means my deduction is more or less on the mark?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's almost exactly right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh! Bull's-eye, bull's-eye! Operation successful!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With the answers checked, I openly showed my delight with my whole body.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So that's how it is, and I figured if I could get more information, I might get closer to the truth. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Come on, come on, I'm the genius girl, as everyone agrees, me included, so I think I could be of a little use to the police, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I flashed a grin at <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmmmmm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now then, what will his answer be?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, excuse me a moment."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, Ise here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Huh? The stolen minivan's been found? All right, I'll head over there right away too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No, I'll send the sergeant over there. I've found a new witness, so I'll join up as soon as the interview's done."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
As soon as <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> hung up, he turned his eyes to me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ummm, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Your</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> thoughts, I'd like to hear them. Let's move somewhere else, and with me... uh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">let's t-talk!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>'s cheeks, not to be outdone by the cherry blossoms, flushed even redder, like maple leaves out of season.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yay! That means you'll give me information too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh... yeah... I guess so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Well, I suppose that'll do too... huh."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
